        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: പരിസ്ഥിതി",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പരിസ്ഥിതി — paristhiti — \"the environment\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്ലാസ്റ്റിക് പരിസ്ഥിതിക്ക് വലിയ ദോഷമാണ്. plāsṟṟikŭ paristhitikkŭ valiya dōṣamāṇŭ. Plastic does great harm to the environment."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പരി-, around, plus സ്ഥിതി, a state: the state of things around us."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പരിസ്ഥിതി (paristhiti) is a modern Malayalam word built from Sanskrit pari, \"around\", and sthiti, \"standing, a state\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
